WEBVTT

01:32.091 --> 01:35.678
Wake up, Granny. Wake up!

01:35.762 --> 01:37.972
This is not the time to be sleeping!

01:39.599 --> 01:40.934
- Wake up!
- Ow!

01:41.976 --> 01:44.312
What?! Tadera!

01:44.395 --> 01:45.605
Can you move?

01:45.688 --> 01:47.816
- Get ready to run.
- What?

01:48.817 --> 01:50.777
What is this place?

01:52.821 --> 01:54.823
What are those?!

01:54.906 --> 01:57.450
Seems like they're not your Daemons.

01:58.034 --> 02:00.036
After all, they killed your friends.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.579
They're no friends of mine.

02:01.663 --> 02:02.956
I don't know those Daemons.

02:03.039 --> 02:04.290
So they're a third party?

02:04.374 --> 02:05.750
Well, this sucks.

02:07.168 --> 02:12.799
How and why did they enter
the clan's Lost House?

02:13.383 --> 02:15.844
You seem to know each other.

02:15.927 --> 02:17.345
We met a long time ago.

02:18.388 --> 02:21.432
They were up to no good up north,

02:21.516 --> 02:24.978
so we helped a traveling monk
and one with the power of Seal

02:25.061 --> 02:27.272
seal them inside Mt. Yamou.

02:27.355 --> 02:28.690
Mt. Yamou?

02:28.773 --> 02:30.525
Modern day Mt. Bandai.

02:30.608 --> 02:33.278
It changed shape after it erupted.

02:33.361 --> 02:37.448
Aren't you supposed to be
sealed inside Mt. Yamou?

02:37.532 --> 02:39.617
Yeah, that's right.

02:39.701 --> 02:43.997
A nice master just dispelled
the seal the other day.

02:44.497 --> 02:48.376
We're finally free
after over a thousand years.

02:48.459 --> 02:51.713
We still owe you for that.

02:51.796 --> 02:53.882
You mutts.

02:53.965 --> 02:57.218
What happened to that monk after that?

02:57.302 --> 03:01.014
We don't know. We heard he's at Mt. Kouya.

03:01.097 --> 03:03.808
According to legend,

03:03.892 --> 03:07.979
Long-Arm and Long-Leg
stomp on fields with their huge legs

03:08.062 --> 03:12.775
and cause floods by scattering lake water
they scoop up in their arms, right?

03:12.859 --> 03:13.985
What the hell is that?

03:14.068 --> 03:17.155
Those damn villagers
have been spreading nonsense

03:17.238 --> 03:20.283
while we were sealed away.

03:20.366 --> 03:22.368
We don't pull pranks like that.

03:22.452 --> 03:23.286
We've been falsely accused.

03:23.369 --> 03:28.082
All we did was eat a few people.

03:28.166 --> 03:30.627
We love the flesh of children.

03:34.005 --> 03:37.133
I see a tasty youngster right there.

03:38.343 --> 03:42.805
He looks like he's starting
to get sinewy, but whatever.

03:42.889 --> 03:46.643
Now, which one of you
is Right and Left's master?

03:46.726 --> 03:48.645
Huh? What?

03:48.728 --> 03:54.317
If Right and Left are here,
does that mean twins have been born?

03:54.943 --> 03:59.072
The one who wields Seal may
be among them, Long-Arm.

03:59.155 --> 04:03.409
We're not getting sealed
away again, Long-Leg.

04:03.910 --> 04:05.495
Right and Left! I command you!

04:06.371 --> 04:08.873
- Defeat them!
- What?!

04:08.957 --> 04:11.584
Why would we listen to...

04:20.218 --> 04:22.679
As you wish, Master!

04:27.517 --> 04:29.727
That man's their master.

04:29.811 --> 04:32.355
We'll take our time eating
the youngster later.

04:33.606 --> 04:36.442
Kill this one first!

05:04.387 --> 05:08.266
He's launching something at us!

05:21.070 --> 05:25.074
They're as wriggly and slippery as ever.

05:25.575 --> 05:28.661
They're not using Seal.

05:28.745 --> 05:31.622
Perhaps its wielder isn't here after all.

05:32.623 --> 05:38.463
This is all the strength you
can muster on your own.

05:41.632 --> 05:46.137
Seal and the monk aren't here this time.

05:46.637 --> 05:49.807
We've held this grudge for 1,200 years.

05:49.891 --> 05:52.393
It's time to face the consequences.

05:54.854 --> 05:56.314
They're terrifying!

05:56.397 --> 05:57.523
Dera-san!

05:57.607 --> 05:58.566
Hey, Yuru.

05:58.649 --> 06:01.736
I'm glad you ran
without me telling you to.

06:01.819 --> 06:02.820
Are you hurt?

06:03.571 --> 06:06.866
Why'd you lie about being
Right and Left's master?

06:07.450 --> 06:09.911
Now you're their target.

06:09.994 --> 06:12.538
I'm your guardian.

06:12.622 --> 06:15.166
Plus, your adorable little sister
asked me to look after you.

06:16.000 --> 06:18.002
Right and Left even went along with it.

06:18.503 --> 06:20.088
I can fight, too, you know.

06:20.171 --> 06:23.216
You're going to fight
Tenaga-Ashinaga like that?

06:23.299 --> 06:25.343
Don't be absurd!

06:26.928 --> 06:31.099
Are you with the Kagemoris
or Higashi Village?

06:40.024 --> 06:42.193
There's no time to waste.

06:42.276 --> 06:43.319
Spit it out!

06:44.487 --> 06:46.280
The Kagemoris.

06:48.908 --> 06:51.369
The Kagemoris aren't all the same.

06:52.078 --> 06:53.204
Which Kagemori?

06:53.287 --> 06:55.998
The second son, Asuma-san!

06:56.666 --> 07:00.711
The village that produces the powers
of Break and Seal can continue to exist.

07:00.795 --> 07:02.880
We shouldn't deny their very existence.

07:03.464 --> 07:04.340
However,

07:04.423 --> 07:06.843
they should exist under the control
of a suitable organization.

07:07.426 --> 07:08.469
Him?

07:09.595 --> 07:14.350
I was told not to harm you guys,
especially the Seal kid,

07:14.434 --> 07:17.937
and to tail you within reason.

07:18.020 --> 07:19.230
Damn it!

07:19.313 --> 07:24.944
Why'd we have to get dragged
into some Daemons' feud?

07:32.368 --> 07:33.536
All right.

07:33.619 --> 07:36.956
At the very least,
it sounds like Granny won't kill us.

07:37.540 --> 07:41.085
You can see them, so you must
be a Daemon Wielder, right?

07:41.169 --> 07:42.211
That's right.

07:42.295 --> 07:43.212
Then help us.

07:43.838 --> 07:45.798
Summon your Daemons and fight.

07:45.882 --> 07:49.135
I can't. We left ours behind.

07:49.218 --> 07:52.096
Right and Left would've
noticed if we brought them.

07:52.180 --> 07:55.808
We were tailing you on our own today.

07:55.892 --> 07:57.560
You're useless!

07:59.312 --> 08:00.771
This kid mentioned it earlier.

08:00.855 --> 08:03.149
This place is a Lost House, right?

08:03.232 --> 08:08.237
Can't we leave Tenaga-Ashinaga
in here and leave?

08:08.321 --> 08:09.405
We can't.

08:10.156 --> 08:12.700
We've got a problem

08:12.783 --> 08:16.412
if they and their master know
how to get in and out of here.

08:16.496 --> 08:20.166
Then I'll look for
their master and catch them.

08:20.666 --> 08:23.044
Daemons prioritize
protecting their master,

08:23.127 --> 08:27.089
so their master is usually nearby, right?

08:27.173 --> 08:28.674
That's true.

08:28.758 --> 08:33.095
They also seem to think
you're just a kid and underestimate you.

08:33.179 --> 08:37.433
Yeah. I think I'm pretty
free to move around.

08:37.517 --> 08:41.979
And since they think
you're Right and Left's master,

08:42.063 --> 08:44.857
I'm completely beneath their notice.

08:44.941 --> 08:49.904
Okay, I'll work with Right and Left
to draw Tenaga-Ashinaga's attention.

08:49.987 --> 08:51.989
You look for their master.

08:52.073 --> 08:53.783
Let's go, Granny.

08:56.536 --> 08:59.664
Fine. It's not like I have a choice.

09:01.666 --> 09:02.792
Hidden knives!

09:03.960 --> 09:06.837
Let's get this over with so I can leave.

09:06.921 --> 09:10.091
I have to cook dinner for my husband.

09:10.174 --> 09:12.426
Housewives are terrifying.

09:25.982 --> 09:28.359
I'll sneak into the armory
without them noticing.

09:54.427 --> 09:57.138
How long do those damn arms stretch?

09:58.556 --> 10:01.851
Man... They wrecked my house.

10:01.934 --> 10:06.230
But now, I can access the armory.

10:09.692 --> 10:11.360
Tenaga-Ashinaga's master...

10:11.444 --> 10:14.113
Where? Where are they?

10:19.910 --> 10:20.953
Found—

10:21.829 --> 10:25.916
Dera-san said people died here,

10:26.417 --> 10:28.544
but there really are corpses everywhere.

10:31.047 --> 10:34.967
They'd be easier to find
if they were exuding bloodlust.

10:35.051 --> 10:38.721
Where is Tenaga-Ashinaga's master?

10:40.014 --> 10:40.848
Damn you.

10:40.931 --> 10:43.351
You're as hard as ever.

10:43.434 --> 10:47.480
Maybe we should kill their master first.

10:47.563 --> 10:48.731
You're right.

10:49.315 --> 10:52.568
Ending their lives as stray Daemons

10:52.652 --> 10:56.989
in this Lost House would be fitting.

11:00.201 --> 11:01.327
Long-Leg!

11:01.410 --> 11:03.204
What's wrong? What happened?

11:03.871 --> 11:06.457
- What happened?!
- Wh-What is this?

11:06.540 --> 11:09.085
Long-Leg!

11:09.168 --> 11:12.004
Nice, it worked.

11:12.088 --> 11:17.301
If they've been sealed for years
and just returned to the modern world,

11:17.802 --> 11:20.137
they aren't familiar with these.

11:20.721 --> 11:24.183
I don't know anything
about a thousand-year grudge,

11:24.266 --> 11:27.520
but grudges are no match
for modern technology.

11:28.521 --> 11:32.691
Don't think you can do whatever
you want on my turf.

11:35.694 --> 11:37.696
Long-Arm!

11:47.289 --> 11:48.541
What is this?

11:48.624 --> 11:50.584
Something's flying at us!

11:50.668 --> 11:51.710
Where—

11:56.382 --> 11:57.425
Right!

11:59.301 --> 12:00.594
Left!

12:05.724 --> 12:07.143
Damn you!

12:11.272 --> 12:13.858
Damn you!

12:15.025 --> 12:20.030
Damn you!

12:20.114 --> 12:24.118
Crap. They'll find me from up there.

12:25.786 --> 12:26.620
Oh?

12:31.876 --> 12:34.128
I found someone!

12:34.753 --> 12:37.631
She's old, but she'll do.

12:37.715 --> 12:41.635
Women are softer
than men and pretty tasty.

12:42.303 --> 12:44.305
We need to eat to heal ourselves.

12:44.388 --> 12:47.641
You eat first, Long-Leg.

12:48.392 --> 12:50.519
You're so nice, Long-Arm.

12:52.313 --> 12:53.981
Wait, wait, wait!

12:54.064 --> 12:56.901
The kid I was with is tastier!

12:56.984 --> 13:00.696
More importantly, that kid is
the twin who will become Seal!

13:02.948 --> 13:05.367
Damn it! She told them!

13:05.951 --> 13:07.286
What did you say?

13:07.369 --> 13:10.581
Wouldn't you rather eat him?!

13:10.664 --> 13:12.875
The kid you were with is Seal?

13:14.960 --> 13:16.128
Oh?

13:16.629 --> 13:21.967
The kid who will become Seal
is somewhere in this place?

13:22.468 --> 13:27.389
A kid who has not yet gained
the power of Seal...

13:28.974 --> 13:32.520
Good, that's it. Go after the kid.

13:32.603 --> 13:37.399
The moment they loosen their grip,
I'll cut the tendons in their wrist.

13:38.817 --> 13:42.905
That aside, we need nutrients
to heal ourselves.

13:56.210 --> 13:58.254
Let the old woman go.

13:58.337 --> 14:00.881
She's got a family waiting
at home for her.

14:01.465 --> 14:05.261
I'm one of the twins
sundering night and day.

14:05.344 --> 14:08.138
I'm also the real master
of Right and Left.

14:08.847 --> 14:09.890
If you have business with me,

14:10.891 --> 14:12.268
come and get me.

14:15.813 --> 14:22.611
This kid is one of the twins
and Right and Left's true master?

14:23.612 --> 14:26.991
She said he'd become Seal.

14:27.074 --> 14:30.786
Then he hasn't gained that power yet.

14:30.870 --> 14:34.290
Yeah. So, what should we do?

14:34.373 --> 14:39.044
If we kill the kid,
he'll gain the power of Seal.

14:39.128 --> 14:42.256
I'm not getting sealed again.

14:42.756 --> 14:46.302
We could kill him again
after he comes back to life.

14:46.385 --> 14:52.766
Those mutts wouldn't stand there
and let that happen, Long-Arm.

14:52.850 --> 14:55.728
Good point, Long-Leg.

14:55.811 --> 14:57.688
Right and Left, don't do anything.

14:58.272 --> 14:59.148
What?

14:59.231 --> 15:01.942
Don't do anything until I say you can.

15:03.027 --> 15:04.695
This is my job.

15:11.410 --> 15:12.953
As you wish!

15:24.924 --> 15:29.595
Those mutts really aren't
doing anything, Long-Leg.

15:30.220 --> 15:34.016
They're such well-trained dogs, Long-Arm.

15:34.099 --> 15:37.603
How do those legs move so much
without any eyes?

15:37.686 --> 15:42.316
Even if my eyes can't see,
Long-Arm acts as my eyes!

15:44.401 --> 15:50.074
Even if my legs can't move,
Long-Leg moves as I wish!

15:53.911 --> 15:57.539
We're two minds in one body!

15:57.623 --> 16:00.334
This is our true form!

16:00.417 --> 16:03.796
Tenaga-Ashinaga!

16:11.553 --> 16:14.390
Damn. They're huge,
but they wriggle around too much.

16:14.473 --> 16:16.100
They're too quick.

16:16.183 --> 16:17.267
I can't get a bead on them.

16:24.191 --> 16:25.192
What?

16:27.236 --> 16:30.072
We see you over there.

16:30.155 --> 16:33.575
We'll spill your guts
after we eat the kid.

16:57.474 --> 16:58.475
All right.

17:16.076 --> 17:17.202
Yuru!

17:38.599 --> 17:41.852
Now, how should we kill him?

17:41.935 --> 17:45.230
Should we tear off his left arm first?

17:45.314 --> 17:50.486
Tear out his tongue so he can't
ask Right and Left for help?

17:58.702 --> 18:03.624
Does this kid already
have the power of Seal?

18:03.707 --> 18:09.630
That man lied about being
Right and Left's master.

18:12.466 --> 18:17.679
Did they lie about not having Seal

18:17.763 --> 18:19.848
to ensure their victory?

18:20.349 --> 18:22.518
You got confused, didn't you?

18:24.061 --> 18:27.689
It made you hesitate for a second,
but that's all we need.

18:28.273 --> 18:30.818
Right and Left wouldn't miss that opening.

18:30.901 --> 18:32.194
You can move now!

18:34.154 --> 18:35.656
Do as you wish!

18:39.118 --> 18:43.497
You'll pay for hurting our master!

18:58.637 --> 19:01.431
Long-Arm! Where did you go?

19:02.099 --> 19:04.685
Answer me, Long-Arm!

19:04.768 --> 19:07.688
I still can't see anything!

19:07.771 --> 19:10.691
What's going on, Long-Arm?

19:11.817 --> 19:14.444
Leg... I'm over here...

19:14.528 --> 19:17.030
Help me, Long...

19:28.917 --> 19:30.210
Long-Arm!

19:31.461 --> 19:32.880
Long-Arm!

20:12.753 --> 20:15.130
So this is their relic.

20:15.672 --> 20:17.257
They're powerful.

20:17.341 --> 20:20.594
They could've become famous gods
if they'd been used for good.

20:21.803 --> 20:23.889
Yuru, are you okay?

20:24.514 --> 20:25.682
Somehow.

20:26.266 --> 20:28.602
Your bluff worked.

20:28.685 --> 20:29.645
Yeah.

20:34.524 --> 20:38.111
Asa's Break involved closing
and opening her hand,

20:39.029 --> 20:40.822
so I figured Seal was the opposite.

20:40.906 --> 20:42.115
I guess I was right.

20:42.616 --> 20:45.118
It scared them more than I expected.

20:45.202 --> 20:50.207
It'd be terrifying if you could
seal those monsters in an instant.

20:51.416 --> 20:56.380
Maybe Seal really is a dangerous power.

20:56.964 --> 21:02.594
It was crazy to take
on Tenaga-Ashinaga without Seal.

21:02.678 --> 21:06.682
I didn't think I could beat them,
but I figured I could evade them.

21:07.182 --> 21:10.644
Just evading them wasn't
your goal, though.

21:10.727 --> 21:14.564
Yeah. I told you, that was just my job.

21:16.316 --> 21:17.401
This is it.

21:17.484 --> 21:21.947
This is the Daemon we've sensed ever
since we left the Kagemori manor.

21:22.614 --> 21:25.158
Its presence was so faint,
we couldn't pinpoint it.

21:25.659 --> 21:30.372
They put human tails on us
so we'd notice them instead?

21:30.956 --> 21:33.875
Our real tail was this butterfly?

21:33.959 --> 21:35.877
That's Asuma-san's Daemon.

21:36.461 --> 21:40.007
To be precise, it's a small part of them.

21:40.590 --> 21:44.803
Destroying that one butterfly
won't hurt them at all.

23:27.614 --> 23:28.907
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:28.990 --> 23:30.325
Really?!

23:30.826 --> 23:31.993
I'm sorry!

23:32.077 --> 23:33.495
Dera-san, is this your son?

23:33.578 --> 23:35.997
He's definitely a stranger to me!

23:36.081 --> 23:37.499
He's not my kid!

23:37.999 --> 23:40.919
Translator: Sho Stifler
